### =====================================================
### WowoClean-BE API Gateway - HTTP Requests
### =====================================================
### Gunakan extension "REST Client" di VS Code untuk menjalankan request ini.
### Install: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=humao.rest-client
###
### Cara pakai: Klik "Send Request" di atas setiap request.
### Setelah login, COPY token dari response dan PASTE ke @token di bawah.
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/gateway

### -----------------------------------------------
### GANTI TOKEN DI BAWAH SETELAH LOGIN
### -----------------------------------------------
@token = eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJodHRwOi8vbG9jYWxob3N0Iiwic3ViIjoxLCJyb2xlIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODAwNzg1NjMsImV4cCI6MTc4MDE2NDk2M30.GY5nMbG3ENtdBTPkQ3jX_rIEuaO-b3L76xQr8t3FFyQ


### =====================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### =====================================================

### 1a. Login sebagai Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@wowoclean.com",
    "password": "password"
}

### 1b. Login sebagai Operator (User biasa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "operator@wowoclean.com",
    "password": "password"
}

### 1c. Login dengan password salah (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@wowoclean.com",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 1d. Get Profile (butuh token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1e. Logout (butuh token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =====================================================
### 2. CONTAINERS - GET (admin & user bisa akses)
### =====================================================

### 2a. List semua containers
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2b. Search containers by waste type
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers/search?type=Chemical
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2c. Search containers by minimum weight
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers/search?min_weight=1000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2d. Search containers by type + min_weight
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers/search?type=General&min_weight=1000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2e. Search yang tidak ada hasilnya (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers/search?type=Radioactive
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =====================================================
### 3. CONTAINERS - POST/PATCH/DELETE (hanya admin)
### =====================================================

### 3a. Buat container baru (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "container_id": "KL44444",
    "waste_type": "General",
    "weight_kg": 500
}

### 3b. Buat container Chemical (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "container_id": "MN55555",
    "waste_type": "Chemical",
    "weight_kg": 800
}

### 3c. Buat container Chemical > 1000kg (expect 422 - conditional validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "container_id": "OP66666",
    "waste_type": "Chemical",
    "weight_kg": 1500
}

### 3d. Buat container dengan format ID salah (expect 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "container_id": "invalid",
    "waste_type": "General",
    "weight_kg": 500
}

### 3e. Update container status ke Archived (admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/containers/KL44444
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3f. Delete container (admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/containers/KL44444
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =====================================================
### 4. TRACKING LOGS
### =====================================================

### 4a. Lihat tracking logs container AB12345 (admin & user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers/AB12345/logs
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4b. Lihat tracking logs container yang tidak ada (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers/ZZ99999/logs
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4c. Tambah tracking log baru ke container AB12345 (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers/AB12345/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "location": "Fasilitas Pengolahan - Tangerang",
    "timestamp": "2026-04-12 10:00:00",
    "description": "Kontainer tiba di fasilitas pengolahan limbah."
}

### 4d. Tambah tracking log baru ke container CD67890 (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers/CD67890/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "location": "Gudang Transit - Yogyakarta",
    "timestamp": "2026-04-13 13:30:00",
    "description": "Kontainer diterima untuk penyimpanan sementara."
}

### 4e. Tambah tracking log ke container yang tidak ada (expect 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers/ZZ99999/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "location": "Gudang X",
    "timestamp": "2026-04-15 08:00:00",
    "description": "Test"
}


### =====================================================
### 5. TEST AUTHORIZATION (Forbidden 403)
### =====================================================
### Gunakan token OPERATOR (login dulu sebagai operator, copy tokennya)
###
### 5a. Operator coba buat container (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "container_id": "XX99999",
    "waste_type": "General",
    "weight_kg": 200
}

### 5b. Operator coba update container (expect 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/containers/AB12345
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5c. Operator coba delete container (expect 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/containers/AB12345
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5d. Operator coba tambah tracking log (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/containers/AB12345/logs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "location": "Test Location",
    "timestamp": "2026-04-20 10:00:00",
    "description": "Test dari operator"
}


### =====================================================
### 6. TEST TANPA TOKEN (Unauthorized 401)
### =====================================================

### 6a. Akses containers tanpa token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/containers
Accept: application/json

### 6b. Akses profile tanpa token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Accept: application/json
